        <p>, inL aI:A had been so manifest that a wortiman pl..yed i• a granite yard in the rite had beard about the cure and had called at Mr. MurraY's lodgings to make hhit: Iry about the Pills. lir. Murray sm. only too glad to be &amp;hie to do • fellow-sufferer servlce, and wawa the man lull instructi tsar to taking the pill. Dr. Mil. hams Pint Pills directly strengthen the blood and Serves, and etlidi It is that they are so farnoae among all dames of people, front the higheM i• the land to the Insert, for the cure of antenna and rheumatiam, scro- fula, chronio eryepelas, paralyals, I .engant, &amp;tatty.' neuralgia, St. Vitus' dense, and nervous headache. They see now obtainable of all chemists. and Iron. On. Ma- nama Medicine Company, London, It 21. It. a hot. or eta tor 13..91 , but sre genuine only vri•t, 'sae., Dr. Wlll,amo' Pink Pills !or Pale People. Pink pills •h I 0 0 from Om jets ars not Dr. Williams'.</p>
