        <p>A kind of mottled shot glees; milk haa been gradually returning into fashion during the last tew month. after an editsse of many years. Its seen ohiedy in tints of golden brown, clouded grey, nnil purple, the hues ranging from darkest mauve ii plum colour. Its very nature prevent. it from showing spots, or being dimmed perceptibly by ....I, and itie one of the most useful silks imagine. for a I I.ly whose gowns of that fabric are few •r,.1 far between.</p>
